WEBVTT

00:02:59.363 --> 00:03:00.997
And they're rubbing your sternum,

00:03:01.021 --> 00:03:03.069
and they're saying, "Wake up, wake up!

00:03:03.093 --> 00:03:05.493
You overdosed, you could've died."

00:03:05.807 --> 00:03:08.490
Now, would you not be defensive and angry?

00:03:08.514 --> 00:03:10.247
Because I know I would be.

00:03:10.858 --> 00:03:12.302
And on top of that,

00:03:12.326 --> 00:03:14.969
those strangers gave you
a dose of naloxone,

00:03:14.993 --> 00:03:17.477
which has sent you into withdrawals,

00:03:17.501 --> 00:03:20.453
or what is better known
as "dope sickness."

00:03:21.529 --> 00:03:25.061
Dope sickness makes you feel
absolutely horrible.

00:03:25.085 --> 00:03:28.175
Some say it's like the flu, times ten.

00:03:28.625 --> 00:03:32.853
Nausea, vomiting, diarrhea, body aches.